WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.234
-Welcome. And thank you
for watching

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:04.801
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.467
Here we are.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:07.834
Let's get to some news.

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:10.734
Well, guys, today, California
voted on whether or not

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.701
to recall their governor,
Gavin Newsom.

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:15.100
Yeah. Newsom was like,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.534
"You can't just get rid of
your governor.

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:18.400
That's crazy."

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.601
Then New Yorkers were like,

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:23.267
"Eh, it's not as crazy
as you think."

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:26.567
Just click the link, yeah.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.567
The recall comes after
major criticism

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:30.667
of Newsom's handling of
the pandemic.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:33.267
Meanwhile, Florida governor
Ron DeSantis is going,

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:36.567
"We don't have recalls
here, do we?

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.868
We don't, right?

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.300
Whew!"

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.567
As of right now,

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.634
it looks like Gavin Newsom
will remain governor.

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:45.968
Newsom spent the day...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:49.133
...spent the day thanking
his staff and supporters.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.701
And they were like,
"Well, you should really thank

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:52.334
Dwayne Johnson for
not running against you,

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:56.267
because we like you, but we
would have voted for him, so..."

00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:57.567
Newsom's main opponent was

00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:00.834
a conservative talk-show host
named Larry Elder.

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:03.067
And I think he knew that
he was in trouble,

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.200
because last night --
and this is true --

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.234
Elder actually posted on
his website asking supporters

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:12.100
to report fraud that resulted
in Newsom winning.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.167
This is before
people started voting.

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:19.467
Wow. Nothing says confidence
like throwing in the towel

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:20.701
before you even get to the ring.

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:22.133
You're like, "You know, I think

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:24.701
you're going to make
the wrong call on this."

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:26.300
Basically, Larry Elder
is the friend

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.868
who unplugs the Nintendo
right before

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:28.868
you beat him in "Mario Kart."

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:30.634
He's like, "Technically,

00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:33.734
it doesn't count as
a win, because...

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:35.434
Meanwhile,
former President Trump

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:37.901
also weighed in by releasing
statement after statement

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:40.200
claiming that the recall
election in California

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.300
would be rigged.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.901
Yeah, without social media,

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.901
Trump is doing whatever
he can to get the message out.

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.200
He even wore it on a dress

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.467
to last night's Met Gala.

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:51.234
-Wow!

00:01:51.234 --> 00:01:55.334
-Can you believe --
a night out like that?

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:58.834
Some news from Russia.

00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:01.534
Vladimir Putin
is now self-isolating

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:03.934
after several members
of his inner circle

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:06.067
tested positive for COVID.

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:07.868
It's weird.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:09.400
I believe this is
the first time Putin

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.868
has ever made himself disappear.

00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:15.100
Russia is a little strange.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.033
It's the only place where
you don't feel so good

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:19.133
and you're like,
"Whew, it's only COVID."

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:21.434
Ahh!

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:23.934
I had tea with Putin the other
day, and I thought -- Yeah.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.834
Whoa-ho-ho-ho!"

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:28.434
Wow! Yeah, you can tell Putin
is nervous about it,

00:02:28.434 --> 00:02:29.934
because the Kremlin
just released a photo

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:34.200
of him stealing dewormer pills
from his horse.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:38.767
[ Russian accent ]
Spit out. Spit out.

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:42.234
Well, last night, the Met Gala
was held here in New York City.

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:44.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
And there -- Yeah.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.067
And there was some wild looks.

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:50.667
One of my favorites was
Kim Kardashian,

00:02:50.667 --> 00:02:54.334
who showed up wearing this
full-body black shroud.

00:02:54.334 --> 00:02:55.567
Look at this.

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:57.467
Yeah, you know that you're
a massive celebrity

00:02:57.467 --> 00:02:59.100
when you show up in that
and people are like,

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.000
"Oh, it's Kim Kardashian."

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.501
Meanwhile, rapper Nicki Minaj
made headlines

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:06.667
last night when
she announced that

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:09.634
she wouldn't get vaccinated
for the event.

00:03:09.634 --> 00:03:11.801
But her reasoning
for not getting the shot

00:03:11.801 --> 00:03:12.868
was pretty strange.

00:03:12.868 --> 00:03:14.133
Listen to this.

00:03:14.133 --> 00:03:18.133
-Rapper Nicki Minaj
says that her cousin's friend --

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:19.567
And she put this on
social media.

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:21.501
She has 22 million followers.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:24.501
She said
he has swollen testicles

00:03:24.501 --> 00:03:25.767
after taking the vaccine.

00:03:25.767 --> 00:03:28.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.300
[ Cymbal crash ]

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.934
-Did that guy know you're
supposed to get the shot --

00:03:33.934 --> 00:03:36.200
You're supposed to
get the shot in your arm.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.601
He knows...

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:40.100
I'll send her a text later.

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.868
-Wow.

00:03:42.868 --> 00:03:44.667
And she didn't go to
the Met Ball.

00:03:44.667 --> 00:03:47.567
Odd.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.567 --> 00:03:51.200
-No, it's too close.
-Yeah.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.868
-Guys, listen to this.

00:03:52.868 --> 00:03:56.167
Fireball is releasing
their own kegs that contain

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:58.634
5 liters of whiskey
called FireKegs.

00:03:58.634 --> 00:04:01.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
Look at this.

00:04:01.734 --> 00:04:04.167
-Oh, no!

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:06.901
-I'm actually relieved, because
when I saw Fireball trending,

00:04:06.901 --> 00:04:08.067
I thought something else
happened to

00:04:08.067 --> 00:04:10.434
Nicki Minaj's cousin's friend.

00:04:14.868 --> 00:04:16.834
Get this -- I read about
a group of scientists

00:04:16.834 --> 00:04:20.901
who are trying to bring back the
long-extinct woolly mammoth.

00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:21.968
Here's what's going to happen.

00:04:21.968 --> 00:04:23.400
The woolly mammoth
will come back

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.767
and immediately start doing
sponsored posts for Gillette.

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:27.701
Just trust me.

00:04:27.701 --> 00:04:30.267
Yep, after they bring back a
beast from the Ice Age,

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:33.167
they're gonna work on
bringing back ice.

00:04:33.167 --> 00:04:35.167
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:36.601 --> 00:04:38.834
Bring back ice.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.200
And, finally,
a company in Berlin --

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.534
You guys like ice?

00:04:45.534 --> 00:04:48.100
Remember ice?

00:04:49.033 --> 00:04:52.400
Finally, a company in Berlin
just secured $50 million

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.100
in funding to expand their
lab-grown-cheese business.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.968
Meanwhile, in America, we've had
lab-grown cheese for years.

00:04:58.968 --> 00:05:00.334
It's called Velveeta.

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:01.934
Hey, we have a great show.

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.067
Give it up for The Roots!

00:05:03.067 --> 00:05:04.634
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:05:04.634 --> 00:05:07.400
-♪ I'm on a mission that some
people think is impossible ♪

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:10.133
♪ But when I'm swingin' my
swords, they're all choppable ♪

00:05:10.133 --> 00:05:11.501
♪ I be the body-dropper,

00:05:11.501 --> 00:05:12.767
