00:05:12.767 --> 00:05:14.667
♪ Child-educator
and head-amputator ♪

00:05:14.667 --> 00:05:18.033
♪ Brothers' styles is old
like Mark 5 sneakers ♪

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:19.100
♪ Never weak ♪

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:22.334
-What a show
we have for you tonight.

00:05:22.334 --> 00:05:25.367
She is one of the biggest
supermodels in the world

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:29.067
and she's got a new tequila
called 818 available now.

00:05:29.067 --> 00:05:30.934
Kendall Jenner is here!

00:05:30.934 --> 00:05:32.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:32.534 --> 00:05:33.767
Ow!

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:36.467
-Come on!

00:05:36.467 --> 00:05:40.234
-Plus, his new cookbook,
"Antoni: Let's Do Dinner,"

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:41.234
is out today.

00:05:41.234 --> 00:05:43.467
Antoni Porowski is here.

00:05:43.467 --> 00:05:45.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
Ow-whoo!

00:05:45.734 --> 00:05:48.601
-Whoo!

00:05:48.601 --> 00:05:51.133
-Antoni Porowski.
I love this dude.

00:05:51.133 --> 00:05:54.133
And it's Broadway Week here at
"The Tonight Show."

00:05:54.133 --> 00:05:55.667
Broadway is coming back.

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:57.067
It is back.

00:05:57.067 --> 00:05:59.734
And every night this week,
we have in-studio performances

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:01.901
from some of the
biggest shows on Broadway.

00:06:01.901 --> 00:06:03.200
We love Broadway so much.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.734
Tonight, we have Tony nominee
Adrienne Warren from

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:09.367
"Tina: The Tina Turner Musical"!

00:06:09.367 --> 00:06:10.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:12.300
Get ready!

00:06:13.767 --> 00:06:15.601
Tonight.

00:06:15.601 --> 00:06:18.033
I was at the
Met Gala last night.

00:06:18.033 --> 00:06:19.934
[ Cheers and applause ]
I was invited. Thank you.

00:06:19.934 --> 00:06:22.033
I was very -- Table 22.

00:06:22.033 --> 00:06:24.234
This is my table card,
just saying,

00:06:24.234 --> 00:06:25.501
just to prove that I was there.

00:06:25.501 --> 00:06:27.868
Table 22 was --
This was the party table.

00:06:27.868 --> 00:06:28.868
-Wow!

00:06:28.868 --> 00:06:30.968
-I was at --
-Who was there with you?

00:06:30.968 --> 00:06:36.067
-My corner of the table was
Pete Davidson...

00:06:36.067 --> 00:06:38.133
-Love him.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:38.133 --> 00:06:41.100
-...Amandla Stenberg,
Lil Uzi Vert.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.534
-Ooh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:42.534 --> 00:06:44.467
-Very funny, by the way.

00:06:44.467 --> 00:06:46.701
He's a trickster, that guy.

00:06:46.701 --> 00:06:48.200
It was just --
But it was amazing.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:52.300
Serena Williams was by me.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.467
You just saw
every single person.

00:06:54.467 --> 00:06:57.701
And Erykah Badu
was there at my table.

00:06:57.701 --> 00:06:59.801
And, yeah, so, we went.

00:06:59.801 --> 00:07:02.367
I got very -- I was at
Thom Browne's table.

00:07:02.367 --> 00:07:05.200
Thom Browne, amazing designer.
I love that guy.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.367
And very lucky to be -- Here's
me in the Thom Browne tux,

00:07:07.367 --> 00:07:08.367
just to say.

00:07:08.367 --> 00:07:09.734
-Ooh-la-la!

00:07:09.734 --> 00:07:12.534
-Not too shabby. There it is.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:12.534 --> 00:07:16.334
Yeah. And they --
He took care of me, and they --

00:07:16.334 --> 00:07:19.200
It's extra-COVID-safe.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.901
It was like four --
I had to do this giant app

00:07:21.901 --> 00:07:24.701
where they scan my face
and then had to re-scan my face.

00:07:24.701 --> 00:07:26.267
And then I had to take
a selfie to prove

00:07:26.267 --> 00:07:28.868
that my face
was scanning my face.

00:07:28.868 --> 00:07:30.968
But it was good. I felt safe.

00:07:30.968 --> 00:07:34.167
At the end of the night,
I was leaving.

00:07:34.167 --> 00:07:36.767
You know, everyone is going
home, and I go, "Yeah."

00:07:36.767 --> 00:07:39.968
And there's, like, these
barriers of bushes and stuff

00:07:39.968 --> 00:07:41.501
so that, you know,

00:07:41.501 --> 00:07:43.133
everyone stays in line
and all that stuff.

00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:45.200
But there was fans kind of
across the street

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.367
taking photos and stuff.

00:07:46.367 --> 00:07:53.834
And I jumped over one of
the fences just to...

00:07:53.834 --> 00:07:56.267
to go say "hi"
to the fans across the street.

00:07:56.267 --> 00:07:58.300
So I just wanted to make sure
I got over there.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:00.334
-Oh, yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:00.334 --> 00:08:01.968
They're getting some ice.

00:08:01.968 --> 00:08:04.567
-I was sitting there --
So, I'm at the table.

00:08:04.567 --> 00:08:08.167
I'm talking to Pete Davidson,
and we're talking.

00:08:08.167 --> 00:08:12.033
And he goes -- They
go, "Please take your seats.

00:08:12.033 --> 00:08:13.634
The entertainment
is about to begin."

00:08:13.634 --> 00:08:14.834
And I go, "Okay, great."

00:08:14.834 --> 00:08:16.767
And it could be anything.
Sometimes, it's a circus.

00:08:16.767 --> 00:08:17.767
Who knows what is it is?

00:08:17.767 --> 00:08:20.934
Sometimes, it's a singer,
whatever.

00:08:20.934 --> 00:08:22.601
And they go,
"Please take your seats.

00:08:22.601 --> 00:08:24.234
The entertainment
is about to begin."

00:08:24.234 --> 00:08:27.801
And Pete goes,
"I got to go the bathroom."

00:08:27.801 --> 00:08:30.534
I go, "No, you can't.
I wouldn't do it now.

00:08:30.534 --> 00:08:32.634
They just said the entertainment
is about to begin."

00:08:32.634 --> 00:08:34.367
He goes,
"Yeah, I got to go, man."

00:08:34.367 --> 00:08:38.067
I go, "I don't know if I would.

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:39.968
I would stay here.

00:08:39.968 --> 00:08:41.300
Wait to the end
of the entertainment.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:42.734
He goes,
"I'm just going to do it now,

00:08:42.734 --> 00:08:43.868
because they're probably just
going to announce it again,

00:08:43.868 --> 00:08:44.868
and I'm just --"

00:08:44.868 --> 00:08:46.300
I go, "Alright, go for it."

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:48.767
So, he gets up and leaves.

00:08:48.767 --> 00:08:52.100
He was -- You know, he was
fashionable and looked great.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.000
He leaves.
I go, "Alright, whatever."

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.234
And as he leaves, maybe
30 seconds later, I hear --

00:08:57.234 --> 00:09:00.367
[ Imitates
marching band playing ]

00:09:00.367 --> 00:09:03.400
A marching band
comes through the exit

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.300
that he was going to
the bathroom.

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:08.300
And there's Pete Davidson
standing there, 6'8",

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.467
with, like, white hair going...

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.767
In the middle of
a marching band.

00:09:13.767 --> 00:09:15.701
I go, "Oh, my God!"

00:09:15.701 --> 00:09:17.601
The ultimate bust of all time.

00:09:17.601 --> 00:09:20.367
He's like, "Well, I guess
that was a bad idea."

00:09:20.367 --> 00:09:22.968
Anyway, I wanted to thank
Anna Wintour,

00:09:22.968 --> 00:09:24.033
I wanted to thank Thom Browne

00:09:24.033 --> 00:09:25.467
for inviting me and having me.

00:09:25.467 --> 00:09:28.367
It was a big night for me and it
was a big night for New York.

00:09:28.367 --> 00:09:29.968
I loved it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:31.701 --> 00:09:34.667
Guys, like I said earlier,
everyone's talking about

00:09:34.667 --> 00:09:36.434
today's recall election
in California.

00:09:36.434 --> 00:09:37.601
There are a lot of candidates

00:09:37.601 --> 00:09:39.667
trying to replace
Governor Gavin Newsom,

00:09:39.667 --> 00:09:41.200
so we wanted to break it all
down for you.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:43.567
It's time for "Fast Stats."
Here we go.

00:09:43.567 --> 00:09:45.901
-♪ Learn some fast stats,
fast stats ♪

00:09:45.901 --> 00:09:50.033
-First, we have Larry Elder.

00:09:50.033 --> 00:09:52.634
His job is
conservative radio host.

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:56.767
Party trick -- Eating
an entire apple in two bites.

00:09:56.767 --> 00:09:58.400
