killed her husband.

00:10:16.567 --> 00:10:18.767
[ Applause ]

00:10:18.767 --> 00:10:21.267
Next up, it's Kevin Faulconer.

00:10:21.267 --> 00:10:23.467
Job --
Former mayor of San Diego.

00:10:23.467 --> 00:10:25.868
Wants to know -- "What's gonna
get you in the driver's seat

00:10:25.868 --> 00:10:29.167
